{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14790","headline":"落第後归山下旧居留别刘起居昆季 · 卢纶","name":"落第後归山下旧居留别刘起居昆季","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞过朝昏，沈忧岂易论。\n有时空卜命，无事可酬恩。\n寄食依邻里，成家望子孙。\n风尘知世路，衰贱到君门。\n醉里因多感，愁中欲强言。\n花林逢废井，战地识荒园。\n怅别临晴野，悲春上古原。\n鸟归山外树，人过水边村。\n潘岳方称老，嵇康本厌喧。\n谁堪将落羽，回首仰飞翻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}